B.X9=new A.a9("How do payments and Smart Settle work?",'Smart Settle works out the fewest payments that clear everyone\'s balance. You can pay a roommate directly (their JazzCash, Easypaisa or bank details are on the request), tap "I Have Paid", and the creditor confirms - only confirmation moves the balance.')
B.Xa=new A.a9("I forgot my PIN. What now?",'Use "Forgot PIN?" on the login screen. We email a one-time reset link (valid 1 hour) and you choose a new PIN. Your old PIN is never revealed or reused.')
B.Xn=new A.a9("What is Demo Mode?","A registration-free sample household (Ali, Ayesha, Bilal) so you can explore every feature. Demo data stays on your device and is separate from real accounts.")
B.X1=new A.a9("Why does a category show a warning?","When one category passes 40% of the monthly budget, HomeSplit flags it so the household notices before the budget does.")
